# Qwen3.8-27B, btbtyler09 GPTQ INT4 (GPTQModel 6.0.3, symmetric, group 32, act-group-aware,
# 256 code + C4 calibration samples; gptq_marlin).
# Measured on an RTX 3090 (docs/research/candidates.md): 17.88 GiB weights, 1.72 GiB KV cache
# (17,347 tokens), ~135 s to healthy.
# Shared by the Qwen3.5-architecture candidate presets (docs/research/candidates.md): thinking off for every
# chat and /tokenize render (the template thinks by default); --language-model-only skips the
# vision tower; bf16 activations (the base model's dtype); --max-num-batched-tokens=1024 bounds
# echo's prompt-logprob spike (full 248k-vocab logits per prompt token of a chunk, not covered by
# vLLM's startup memory profile); --generation-config=vllm ignores the upload's sampling defaults.
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL=btbtyler09/Qwen3.8-27B-GPTQ-4bit
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL_REVISION=b64f44dfedb71b73287219e0ec348b0a20c447e2
JEVEMU_VLLM_DTYPE=bfloat16
JEVEMU_VLLM_MAX_MODEL_LEN=8192
JEVEMU_VLLM_GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.95
JEVEMU_VLLM_DEFAULT_CHAT_TEMPLATE_KWARGS='{"enable_thinking":false}'
JEVEMU_VLLM_EXTRA_ARGS='--language-model-only --max-num-seqs=16 --max-num-batched-tokens=1024 --generation-config=vllm'
